# boot/svc/input.ndb: inputd (M7 step 7c1, docs/proto/input.md): every input
# driver's records, gathered and served as text on /srv/input, which the
# namespaces union into /dev (/dev/input); and typed into the console's
# kbdin (the console is its namespace's root) until winsrv takes the keyboard. A connector to each post an
# input driver may serve: a post with no driver never answers.

service=inputd program=/boot/bin/inputd post=input console restart
mount=/ srv=cons
connect=input0
connect=input1
connect=input2
connect=input3
